      "parameters": {
        "description": "Live open slots on a client's scheduling link (Cal.com, Calendly or HubSpot, decided by the link in the Hub registry). Input: client = the client name as in the Hub (e.g. Adelante, Flowroots, Move PLNR), timezone = the LEAD's IANA timezone (e.g. America/New_York), days = window in days (default 7), max = how many slots to return (default 8). Returns ok, scheduler, link, duration_minutes and slots[] with start (ISO in the lead's timezone) and label (e.g. 'Mon 24 Aug, 10:30'). Use it before offering any time; never invent a slot.",
