      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        260,
        640
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "description": "Makes every campaign labelled with a tag carry exactly that tag's member inboxes. Inputs: client = the client name as in the Hub registry (e.g. Dave.io, Adelante, Move PLNR), tag = the inbox tag to allocate by (e.g. gateway, active). It reads the tag's member inboxes and each selected campaign's current sender list, adds what is missing, removes what does not belong, then reads the list back. Returns ok, client, tag, selection (how the campaigns were picked), members, skipped_error_status and campaigns[] with id, name, added[], removed[], failed[] and final_count. Read-only when nothing differs. Use it after any tag change; tags alone never move a campaign's senders.",
